  "description": "Chubby Sketch is a fun, quirky, and hand-drawn display font with a playful 3D hatched shadow effect. Inspired by classroom doodles and comic book sketches, this chunky bubble font brings a joyful and authentic hand-lettered vibe to any creative project.\nWhether you are designing for children’s books, school posters, crafting projects, quirky merchandise, or playful quote arts, Chubby Sketch makes your designs stand out with its bold outline and casual charm. Perfect for Crafters using Cricut or Silhouette, as well as digital designers looking for a cheerful, cartoon-style aesthetic.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Chubby Sketch is a fun, quirky, and hand-drawn display font with a playful 3D hatched shadow effect. Inspired by classroom doodles and comic book sketches, this chunky bubble font brings a joyful and authentic hand-lettered vibe to any creative project.</p>\n<p>Whether you are designing for children’s books, school posters, crafting projects, quirky merchandise, or playful quote arts, Chubby Sketch makes your designs stand out with its bold outline and casual charm. Perfect for Crafters using Cricut or Silhouette, as well as digital designers looking for a cheerful, cartoon-style aesthetic.</p>",
